logTest is test
logTest purpose "log, log2, log10, log1p give the correctly rounded value within one last place at sample points, in double and float forms"
logTest verifies naturalLogarithm givesLog
logTest verifies naturalLogarithmSingle givesLog
logTest verifies logarithmBase2 givesLog2
logTest verifies logarithmBase2Single givesLog2
logTest verifies logarithmBase10 givesLog10
logTest verifies logarithmBase10Single givesLog10
logTest verifies logarithmOnePlus givesLog1p
logTest verifies logarithmOnePlusSingle givesLog1p
